 "name_en": "Inventory Valuation for Year-End Closing (BEJ)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Inventory Valuation for Year-End Closing (BEJ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioeb8c1a470e9b43ad88884a929251e4e5\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeb8c1a470e9b43ad88884a929251e4e5__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item provides you with a collection of inventory valuation methods and steps that can be used as a template to form your own valuation processes. Inventory valuation is performed in accordance with local legislation (such as the German Commercial Code), including settings for overhead structure, valuation variant, and stock valuation with devaluation based on movement rate.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeb8c1a470e9b43ad88884a929251e4e5__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform stock valuation for raw materials and trading goods</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine lowest value for raw materials and trading goods based on market prices</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine lowest value for raw materials and trading goods based on range of coverage</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine lowest value for raw materials and trading goods based on movement rates</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform FIFO valuation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze stock valuation for materials using price comparison for each material stock account, material type, or material</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Adjust stock value by posting manually to the relevant stock adjustment account</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeb8c1a470e9b43ad88884a929251e4e5__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine stock valuation for raw materials and trading goods based on the lowest value principle</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine inventory valuation for semi-finished and finished products based on local requirements for valuation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Adjust stock value</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>年末关账的库存评估 (BEJ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioeb8c1a470e9b43ad88884a929251e4e5\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeb8c1a470e9b43ad88884a929251e4e5__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目为您提供了一系列库存评估方法和步骤，可用作形成自己的评估流程的模板。库存评估根据当地法规（如德国商法）执行，包括间接费用结构设置、评估变式和基于移动率的贬值库存评估。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeb8c1a470e9b43ad88884a929251e4e5__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">执行原材料和贸易货物的库存评估</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据市场价格确定原材料和贸易货物的最低价值。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据覆盖范围，确定原材料和贸易货物的最低价值</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据周转率确定原材料和贸易货物的最低价值。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行先进先出评估</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用每个物料库存科目、物料类型或物料的价格比较分析物料的库存评估</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过手动过账到相关库存调整科目，调整库存价值</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeb8c1a470e9b43ad88884a929251e4e5__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">根据最低价值原则，确定原材料和贸易货物的库存评估</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据评估的本地要求，确定半成品和成品的库存评估</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">调整库存值</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
